        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Jadual Pertama kepada Kanun dipinda dengan memasukkan"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "selepas butiran yang berhubungan dengan seksyen 424 Kanun Keseksaan dan butir-butir yang berhubungan dengannya butiran dan butir-butir yang berikut: 1 2 3 4 5 Penal Offence Whether Whether a Whether Code the police warrant or bailable may a summons or not ordinarily shall arrest ordinarily without issue in warrant the first or not instance “424a Possession May do. do. or control arrest of payment without instrument warrant or account Penal Offence Whether Whether a Whether Whether Code the police warrant or bailable compoundable may a summons or not or not ordinarily shall arrest ordinarily without issue in warrant the first or not instance 424b Giving do. do. do. do. possession or control of payment instrument or account to other person 424c(1) Engaging do. do. do. do. in transaction using his payment instrument or his account without lawful purpose 424c(2) Engaging do. do. do. do. in transaction using payment instrument of other person or account of other person without lawful authority or lawful purpose"
      }
    }
